@host = http://localhost:5080
@id = replace-with-id-from-create

### Створити; скопіюй id із відповіді в @id
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":"C-001","lines":[{"productId":"P-001","name":"Кабель USB-C","price":125.50,"quantity":2}]}

### Список
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### За ID
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}

### Сума: 251.00
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}/total

### Замінити
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":"C-002","lines":[{"productId":"P-002","name":"Миша","price":300,"quantity":3}]}

### 400: помилки полів
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":"","lines":[{"productId":"","name":"","price":-1,"quantity":0}]}

### 400: порожній масив
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":"C-001","lines":[]}

### 400: неправильний тип
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":"C-001","lines":[{"productId":"P-1","name":"X","price":1,"quantity":"abc"}]}

### 400: порожнє тіло
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

### Видалити: 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}

### Після видалення: 404
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}

### OpenAPI (Development)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
